 

# 1. Introduction         

## **1.1 Overview**

The [KalMix Scout Pro](https://www.kalmixtech.com/products/kalmix™-scout-pro) Smart GNSS Receiver is a total solution GNSS receiver, designed based on **MediaTek AG3335AT**. This positioning application meets strict needs such as car navigation, mapping, surveying, security, agriculture and so on. Only clear view of sky and certain power supply are necessary to the unit. It communicates with other electronic utilities via compatible TYPE-C and saves critical satellite data by built–in backup memory. With low power consumption, the KALMIX SCOUT PRO has 135 channels and DSP accelerators, re-acquires satellite signals in 100 ms and updates position data up to 10Hz.

Trickle-Power allows the unit operates a fraction of the time and Push-to-Fix permits user to have a quick position fix even though the receiver usually stays off.

 

## **1.2. Features**

G-Mouse provides a host of features that make it easy for integration and use.

1. Use the advanced GNSS module, the module got high performance DSP core (32bit ARM RISC), allow users to design different applications, store in the module, to provide the most economical solution for anybody.
2. High performance tracks up to 135 channels.
3. High sensitivity (-165 dBm) for indoor fixes. The KALMIX SCOUT PRO GNSS module can acquire in only seconds even at low signal levels. As part of KALMIX SCOUT PRO’s patented multi-mode GNSS, the KALMIX SCOUT PRO GNSS module can track signal levels as low as -165 dBm. The KALMIX SCOUT PRO supports real-time navigation in urban canyons as well as high sensitivity acquisition needed for indoor environments. 
4. Differential capability utilizes real-time RTCM corrections producing 1-5 meter position accuracy (MSM1).
5. Compact design ideal for applications with minimal space.
6. A rechargeable battery sustains internal clock and memory. The battery is recharged during normal operation.
7. Built-in WAAS Demodulator.
8. Waterproof IP67 design for industry standard.
9. Built-in high gain 33mm*33mm*6mm and 25mm*25mm*4mm ceramic patch-antenna.
10. Power on accord with IEC 61000-4-2 (ESD) ±15kV (air), ±8kV (contact)
11. Power off accord with IEC 61000-4-2 (ESD) ±25kV (air), ±15kV (contact)
12. GNSS reception:

​		GPS/QZSS: L1 C/A, L5 

​		GLONASS: L1OF 

​		GALILEO: E1(E1B+E1C), E5A 

​		BEIDOU: B1I, B2A 

​		SBAS: WAAS, EGNOS, MSAS, GAGAN

 

